/* Settings sidebar tab, main switch and request window title for the menu opened by right-clicking. Use the everyday term for this menu. */
"Right-Click Menu" = "右键菜单";
/* Finder right-click menu item that copies selected paths or the current folder path. */
"Copy Path" = "复制路径";
/* Finder extension access caption on macOS 13 and 14, shared by the request window and inline controls. Refers to all MaCursor shortcuts, not only Copy Path. MaCursorFinder is the extension product name and stays untranslated. */
"Enable MaCursorFinder in System Settings to add MaCursor’s shortcuts to Finder’s right-click menu." = "在“系统设置”中启用 MaCursorFinder，即可将 MaCursor 的快捷操作添加到 Finder 的右键菜单。";

