"The Finder extension is turned off." = "Finder 扩展已关闭。";

/* Finder extension access instructions on macOS 15.2 and later. Use Apple's exact localized System Settings labels, including spacing. MaCursorFinder is the extension product name and stays untranslated. */
"Turn on MaCursorFinder in System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions → Extensions → File Providers." = "请在“系统设置”→“通用”→“登录项与扩展”→“扩展”→“文件提供程序”中开启 MaCursorFinder。";

