"macOS 15.0 and 15.1 cannot turn on Finder extensions from System Settings. Copy the command and run it in Terminal." = "macOS 15.0 和 15.1 无法从“系统设置”开启 Finder 扩展。请复制命令并在“终端”中运行。";

